/*
 * TestRiscvSemantics.cpp
 *
 * Tests of the RISC-V lifter of the scalar instructions (RiscvSemantics.h):
 * the rows of tests/riscv/RiscvSemanticRows64.inc and RiscvSemanticRows32.inc
 * (an instruction, a start state and the state QEMU and Spike end in,
 * generated by tests/riscv/semantics/gen_unit_rows.py) run by the
 * interpreter, the coverage of the encoding tables by the semantic tables,
 * the classification, the Zicfilp / Zicfiss rules and the helpers.
 *
 * The differential tests against QEMU, Spike and Unicorn
 * (tests/riscv/semantics) cover the whole corpus; these rows pin a sample of
 * it without the processors.
 *
 * Author: Elad Raz <e@eladraz.com>
 */
